🏦 Banking Data Analytics Project

📌 Project Overview
This is an end-to-end **Banking Data Analytics project** focused on analyzing customer, banking, and transaction data to generate meaningful business insights and future predictions.

The project uses three datasets:
1.Bank Data
2.Customer Data
3.Transaction Data

The datasets are processed and analyzed using Python, SQL, Machine Learning, and Power BI as different stages of the project.
 
