↓
7.Power BI – Interactive Dashboard

## Current Stage — Python
The current phase focuses on preparing the banking datasets using Python.

Key activities include:

* Data understanding and exploration
* Data cleaning
* Missing-value handling
* Data transformation
* Data type correction
* Dataset merging
* Creation of the final consolidated dataset

After completing the Python data preparation, the final dataset has been connected with **MySQL Server** for the next stage of analysis.

🗄️ Next Stage — SQL Analysis
The next step of the project is **SQL-based business analysis.

The objective is to develop and answer business questions using the final dataset and extract meaningful insights related to:

* Customer behavior
* Account types
* Transactions
* Balances
* Investments
* Customer segments
* Banking performance
* Regional trends

🤖 Future Stage — Machine Learning

After completing the SQL analysis, Machine Learning techniques will be applied to the prepared banking data.

The objective will be to identify patterns and build models for future prediction.

📊 Final Stage — Power BI Dashboard
The final stage will transform the analytical results into an interactive Power BI dashboard.

The dashboard will provide a visual representation of key business insights, trends, customer behavior, transaction performance, and other important banking metrics.

🛠️ Technologies Used

**Python | Pandas | SQL | MySQL | Machine Learning | Power BI**

🎯 Project Objective
The main objective is to build a complete data analytics pipeline that transforms raw banking data into **clean data, business insights, predictive analysis, and interactive visualizations**.

